    {
      "id": "section-8",
      "title": "心跳",
      "semantics": "心跳记录的人类可读详情：把 session/agent/goal/task/claims/status/年龄/turn/时间戳/stats 排成对齐的 label-value 行；纯展示、不改记录，start/update/end/status 复用同一渲染。",
      "members": [
